WEBVTT

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:24.870
Dukedom of
\h\h\h\h Bleichröder

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:24.870
Breichburg

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:24.870
Great Rieg Mountains

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:24.870
Baumeister Knightdom

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.220
The crown has wanted to develop

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:22.040
this ridiculously large swath of untapped land

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.870
and reap huge benefits for several years now.

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:31.410
But no matter how much time passes, 
it's not getting built up.

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.420
Why do you think that is?

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:38.200
Because the lords of these lands have 
all been ordinary people for generations?

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.530
Correct.

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:46.920
On top of that, the next heir in line 
is both ordinary and a scumbag.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:49.220
The royal palace is at their wit's end.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.230
That's when you came into the picture.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:04.910
Naturally, those in the palace 
want to replace the current lord.

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:09.170
But they can't give my father such an order.

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:13.490
Yeah, because then every lord 
in the country would be afraid.

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:17.930
Afraid that they might be replaced, 
too, if it came down to it.

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:21.220
Which is why the royal 
palace hatched their plot.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:23.600
Plot?

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:25.290
You can't mean...

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:29.670
That's exactly what I mean.

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:33.690
They're going to make that scumbag 
brother of yours blow his top.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.220
Then, once you've subjugated him,

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:41.580
they'll have your father retire to take 
responsibility for his heir's scandal.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:45.790
That sets you up to replace him as lord.

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:53.000
Then the whole reason they sent me 
here was to provoke Brother Kurt?

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.120
Yes.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:59.720
Fortunately enough, our lord did have the 
problem of undead that needed purifying.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:02.560
He took advantage of that, 
knowing that if he sent you home,

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:05.820
the people would wish for 
you to replace the heir...

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:11.710
and that would cause your brother 
to panic and try to kill you.

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:14.990
Wait... If we were embarking 
on such a dangerous operation,

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:17.380
you should have told me ahead of time.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:21.060
But you don't want to become the lord, right?

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:23.740
Yeah, th-that's true, but...

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:28.820
Fortunately, this plot was one 
that could be carried out

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:31.590
whether you knew the truth or not.

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:34.020
So I kept quiet about it for the time being.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:37.420
What were you planning to 
do if I actually got killed?

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.610
You think they could kill you that easily?

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:44.130
I've been keeping an eye on you, after all.

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:46.890
That's why you never drank any liquor!

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:52.350
That mead sure did look good, though.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:57.320
Still, though, making me the lord?

00:02:57.560 --> 00:02:58.890
What're you saying?

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:01.120
You're the perfect man for the job.

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:05.580
You already possess the vast assets 
needed to develop this land.

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:09.920
Sure, I have more money than 
I know what to do with, but...

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:14.910
Wait, are you saying I kept 
getting all that money

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:18.300
just so I could develop this land one day?

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.530
Just how far back did this scheme start?

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:31.280
Who knows? What I just told you 
is partially my own speculation.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:36.190
One thing is certain, though.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:41.620
The curtain's already risen on this show.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:46.740
<i>I just hope it doesn't 
turn out to be a tragedy.</i>

