00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:17.150
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:17.150
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:23.460
Episode 11
Between a Rock and a Hard Place? Are You Kidding Me?!

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.770
We have no choice but to do what 
the royal palace wants, right?

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:36.100
They did say you'd be able to keep 
adventuring after becoming the lord.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.670
This is unusual.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:43.950
Normally you'd just go ahead and 
agree to any orders from above,

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:45.780
not agonize over it this much.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.900
Well, you have visitors.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.180
Here I go.

00:05:58.180 --> 00:05:59.290
Okay!

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.500
Wow!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:10.520
I guess this is why he's constantly 
been agonizing over it.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:14.680
Huh? You mean if Well becomes 
the lord, then those kids...

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.990
They'll lose their future as nobles.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:22.050
Depending on the outcome, they may 
even have to leave this land.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.990
Sir Hermann, this is bad!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.650
Listen up, everyone.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:47.490
I want you to understand that our 
future rests upon these demands.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:48.740
Let's go!

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:49.860
Yeah!

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:56.120
Sir Hermann.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:58.480
Hey, what's going on here?

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.810
Jurgen, explain yourself.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.400
Um...

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:08.280
We're going to Sir Artur with our demands.

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:09.740
Demands?

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:14.720
We want the heir to be 
Sir Wendelin, not Sir Kurt!

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:15.520
Huh?

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:20.900
I understand how you feel, 
but Brother Kurt will never allow that.

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:22.370
And if this goes poorly, you'll all...

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.710
We're not afraid of punishment!

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:31.390
Sir Kurt is giving favorable treatment 
only to those close to him,

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:35.430
and just wringing taxes out of everyone else!

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:42.350
We have all prepared ourselves to fight 
for the future of our grandchildren!

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:46.320
Sir Wendelin, please become our lord!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:52.620
Um, please give me some more time.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.440
But we've heard they'll finish identifying 
the dead men's things tomorrow,

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:59.060
and that you'll be leaving this land then.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.750
That's why we moved quickly to action.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.060
Wait a minute.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:06.460
I haven't made any plans like that.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.980
Huh? But...

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.420
You told us that, right?

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.280
Me?

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.880
Nuh-uh, it wasn't me.

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:15.620
It was you, right?

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:16.140
Huh?

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:17.810
I never said that.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.100
Wait... Who <i>did</i> say it?

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.480
But my wife told me she heard it from you.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.020
What? No way!

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.060
It had to be you!

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:25.980
It wasn't me!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:31.620
You've made quite a few moves, haven't you?

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:33.200
Moves?

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:36.160
I have no idea what you speak of.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:39.090
You say this is all for the people,

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:43.620
but encouraging them to 
face death and demand it...

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.130
You're a sly one.

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:53.350
If that boy becomes the lord, 
the future of this land is bright.

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:57.300
I imagine you'll be given fine treatment, too.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.770
I don't want anything like that.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:05.550
It's fine. What you're doing isn't wrong.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:09.840
It's just that the royal palace doesn't 
like others acting on their own.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.480
So if you push any harder...

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:15.840
I thank you for the warning.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:17.700
But...

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:21.250
I am only a simple village chief.

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.800
I will never be anything more,

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:26.540
nor anything less.

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:27.710
Excuse me.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.380
Sir Brantag...

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:44.920
Do be careful around Lady Amalie.

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:01.060
Sir Kurt, how long is that man staying here?

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:03.940
Listen...

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:06.230
This is hard for me to say,

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:07.730
but if he stays here too long,

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:10.580
those ignorant villagers will turn to him.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.230
I will not allow it!

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:15.960
Any who oppose me shall be severely punished!

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:18.200
Their families, too!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:22.450
I will not tolerate it!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.900
Thank goodness that didn't 
become a serious matter.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:32.640
Still, you need to figure 
out your answer soon,

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:36.810
or there's a good chance those people 
will do the same thing again.

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:42.000
By the way, if I were to become the lord,

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.220
what would happen to Brother Kurt?

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.420
Exile?

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:51.600
Do you think the royal palace would 
just ignore a spark of chaos?

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:56.270
What? Then...

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:58.010
He'll be erased.

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:01.740
Boy,

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.970
you still don't understand nobles.

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:12.650
I hope your feelings get through to him.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:18.950
Later.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:32.000
Dukedom of
\h\h\h\h Bleichröder

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:32.000
Southern Archipelago

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:35.960
So... I have a request.

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:43.010
When Father retires and you become the lord...

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:47.850
I would like to receive some of the land.

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:52.290
If you agree to that,

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.770
I can help you raise your noble rank,

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:58.020
and I can help provide funds 
to develop the land, as well.

00:11:58.490 --> 00:11:59.920
Once development is underway,

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:02.520
our people will be able to enjoy richer lives,

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:05.940
and it will ensure the Baumeister 
family advances, too!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:08.490
So?

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:15.080
All of the land that father actually 
controls would still pass on to you,

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:18.090
so you wouldn't see any change 
to your current lifestyle.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.070
In return...

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.920
Great Rieg Mountains

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.920
Baumeister Knightdom

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.920
Undeveloped Land

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.130
Dukedom of
\h\h\h\h Bleichröder

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.130
Breichburg

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.130
Great Rieg Mountains

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.130
Baumeister Knightdom

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.130
Undeveloped Land

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.130
Southern Coast

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.130
I would take over the undeveloped land.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.680
The Kingdom of Helmut

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.100
Dukedom of
\h\h\h\h Blois

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.100
Dukedom of
\h\h\h\h Bleichröder

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:26.520
I see.

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.580
I understand all too well now.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:32.570
That snake's tongue is how you 
climbed to your current position.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.220
But I won't be swindled!

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:37.430
That's how you'll steadily 
steal away my authority,

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:39.820
eventually becoming the lord yourself!

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:40.940
No, I won't!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:43.420
At this rate, there will be 
a rebellion in this land,

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:45.780
and both you and your family will—

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:46.490
Silence!

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:54.060
You annoy me!

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:57.880
Leave here at once, you thief!

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:16.510
To be honest, I suspected this might happen.

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:20.150
That was the proposal

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.820
that would avoid hurting anyone, 
but it wouldn't make Brother Kurt,

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.550
the villagers, the palace, 
or anyone else happy.

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:32.060
I don't know what else to do.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:38.780
I don't care what anyone else may think,

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:41.340
so long as I can protect my children.

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:45.830
Even now, I'm having them get close to you

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:50.550
and appeal to your emotions so that 
they won't lose their noble status.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.860
Some people might call that devious, I'm sure.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:57.020
No way.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:01.230
Even if they do, that's fine.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:06.700
Because that's what I'm prepared 
to face as their mother.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:09.080
Prepared...

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:15.120
I'm sorry for taking up your time.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:18.090
Let's take this back and show it to Mom.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.210
Yeah!

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:21.160
I bet she'll like it.

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:25.020
Oh, how pretty.

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:28.980
Look at this, Mom!

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:33.430
Isn't it pretty?

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.470
No! You can't eat them!

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:46.730
Eggs, eggs, eggs...

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:48.580
My arms are killing me...

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:50.490
Iina, switch with me!

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:53.110
Hey, Well's using magic! Cheater!

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.450
Come on, everyone, add the oil.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:03.700
Hey, so listen...

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:07.340
I'm planning to become the lord of this land.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:17.090
I'm probably going to end 
up hurting lots of people,

00:15:17.090 --> 00:15:19.040
and some will probably hate me.

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:23.680
But this time, I'm prepared to face that.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:28.470
I'm not going to follow the
 royal palace's script, though.

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.720
I'm not going to let anyone die.

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:34.470
So...

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:37.620
I'll need help from all of you.

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:43.780
Whoa, whoa, whoa! You're adding too much oil!

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:48.270
It's separating again!

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:49.800
What are you doing?!

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:52.780
Hey! I told you, you can't eat it!

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.510
So good!

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:57.770
Wendelin.

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:03.940
We're always on your side.

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:15.760
Come, come!

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:18.090
We have the magic seasoning that goes with

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:22.020
vegetables, bread, meat, 
and everything else: mayonnaise!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.710
Oh, my, this is good!

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:27.850
Give me some!

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:28.670
Me, too!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:31.480
Here you go! All the latest 
clothing from the capital!

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:33.130
First come, first served!

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:39.560
These are all items made by 
the craftsmen of Breichburg!

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:43.520
We have items you can 
only find in the capital!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.730
These are good wares.

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:49.860
The stuff in Eckhart's shop 
doesn't hold a candle to these.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:59.080
It's already been a week since 
they opened up their bazaar.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:04.150
Tsk! They've taken all the 
customers away from our shops!

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:09.540
I had no idea the goods in Breichburg 
and the capital were that well-made.

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:12.760
Yeah, at this rate, we're all...

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:15.530
Um, Sir Kurt?

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.190
In theory...

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:19.640
What if we just killed that man?

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.130
Are you a fool?!

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:24.530
We're a facing a magician!

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:26.640
It's obvious he'd turn the tables on us!

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:28.940
How could you not even realize that?!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:33.570
We might be done for...

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.220
Sir Kurt!

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:02.510
They've betrayed us!

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:05.960
That damn Wendelin!

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:07.940
He threatened them with magic?!

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:11.960
Uh, actually, he didn't threaten them...

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:18.300
So you're saying you provided 
them all the funds they needed

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:20.370
to retrain their crafts here in the capital?

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:24.690
Even if they wanted to learn 
more about their craft,

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:26.950
there's no one to teach them 
out there on the outskirts,

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.080
so they were pleased.

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:32.730
That's true, if they hone their skills, 
they'll be able to find work anywhere.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:36.300
They won't have any more 
reason to cling to Sir Kurt.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:42.570
And that's how I'll thin the ranks of my 
brother's supporters until he's all alone.

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:45.270
Driving him into a corner with 
a bazaar! How like you, my lord!

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:49.040
I just hope he really does blow his top over it.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:51.770
Here it is.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.050
Yeah, this is good.

00:18:56.050 --> 00:18:58.650
It's spacious, and the kitchen is nice, too.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:03.030
I believe this should be enough 
for Lady Amalie and her two sons.

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:08.620
It'll be hard on her sons, 
living away from their homeland.

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:13.710
It will be better than living in shame.

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:20.060
Okay, then we'll have them 
live here after the turmoil.

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:21.500
What about the other part?

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:26.650
We'll have Sir Kurt join this institution.

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:29.330
I see. A church, huh?

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:32.860
If we can bring him here
 after everything is over,

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:35.980
even the royal palace will 
find it difficult to reach him.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:41.320
The rest depends on my negotiations 
with Cardinal Hohenheim.

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:46.840
But he'll be confined to a life 
of repentance and prayer.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:51.080
That might be rather harsh for Sir Kurt.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.480
Even so, at least he'll still be alive.

00:19:57.450 --> 00:20:00.760
So, how are things at the mansion? Any changes?

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:03.540
Well, if I had to say,

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:07.810
the number of people who wish to meet 
with you has been growing by the day.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:08.720
With me?

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:12.430
Oh, they're after the rights 
to the undeveloped land.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:14.500
It is a project that will 
move a lot of money,

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:17.640
so everyone is desperate to be involved in it.

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:22.280
Lord Marshall Edgar and 
Lord Commissioner Ruckner

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:24.910
have been constantly sounding me out, too.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:29.070
Those individuals are already 
close to you, my lord,

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:30.960
so I imagine they're quite pleased,

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:35.880
but the nobles without much connection 
to you are growing incredibly impatient.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.940
Take this to him.

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:45.640
As you wish.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:00.630
Hey! Today's the day of the village meeting!

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:02.220
Why is nobody here?!

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:07.320
Because... they're all with Sir Wendelin.

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:16.500
Um, the truth is, Sir Wendelin came to 
me the other day with an offer, too.

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.250
An offer to train in the capital.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:23.320
Not you, too...

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:24.420
I'm sorry!

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:46.060
Do you think you can kill him with that?

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:49.240
You!

00:21:52.780 --> 00:21:56.050
This is a magic item known 
as the Dragon's Flute.

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:59.870
With this, you can be sure to kill him.
